& [Constructive]
  + complete A5 receipt nesting conserves predecessor rejection interval and revocation assertions with fewer new duplicated fields
  + replayed plan supplies exact minimum junction sources upstream roles five path roles and reserved ref from signed inherited proposal
  + separate current carrier pin avoids conflating incompatible historical expectations and permits future collectors to provide observations without altering old signed artifacts
  + ordered Boolean comparisons and reasons are useful audit output even when one or every expectation differs
& [Adversarial]
  + untrusted manifest rehash cannot authorize current state or change pinned source requirements schemas or authority fields
  + forged plan namespace and rebound inherited plan digest refuse; signed old proposal remains fixed
  + missing/null junction target and ordered-coordinate laundering are malformed, while present unknown wrong target or wrong profile/digest states remain mismatch data
  + both rejected and authorized legacy decisions retain their actual A5 receipt when observations match; matching does not convert rejection to consent
  + top-level and nested truth effects are independently checked; no flatten or lossy A5 summary
& [Resolution]
  + use seven invariant positives ten variable comparisons fourteen global false fields plus entire113-field A5 receipt
  + constructor/parser tests must prove every valid mismatch combination at the comparison helper; full-chain tests cover representative combinations and each mismatch
  + this is two review perspectives by one agent, not independent reviewers
